msgstr "Usar servidor de control remoto"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\dialogs.py:274
msgid "Host Control Server"
msgstr "Crear servidor de control local"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether sounds play instead of beeps.
